<title>UK: ALBERT FISHER TERMINATES TALKS TO SELL CO.</title>
<headline>ALBERT FISHER TERMINATES TALKS TO SELL CO.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>British food distributor Albert Fisher Group Plc said on Thursday it had terminated talks to sell the company.</p>
<p>&quot;In the board's opinion, the potential offeror was not in a position to make an offer which could be recommended to shareholders,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
